  "slug": "catering-order-form",
  "title": "Catering Order Form",
  "subtitle": "The catering order the kitchen and driver work from: production quantities, allergen plan, pack list, transport holding, and on-site setup.",
  "description": "An original off-premise catering order. It records order identity and delivery routing, production quantities by item with the allergen plan, the pack list and transport holding plan with equipment that must return, on-site setup and service instructions, authorization, open conditions, and distribution to the kitchen, driver, and on-site lead.",
  "use_case": "Use as the single operating document for one off-premise catering delivery, from production through transport to on-site service and equipment return. The order closes when the kitchen, driver, and on-site lead have acknowledged the current revision.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
