        {
          "key": "allergen_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Allergen and dietary boundary",
          "guidance": "This order records the dietary and allergen requirements the client provided and how the kitchen intends to separate and label them. It does not certify that any item is free of an allergen and it is not a medical or food-safety determination. The venue does not control the site after handover. Re-confirm each requirement with the client contact and the chef on duty, and route any requirement that cannot be met safely to the responsible manager."
        }
      ]
